[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 36: the highest required level of its quests is 33 (Morgan Stern, 1260), but its mobs are 35-39. Stormwind, Menethil and the Theramore town quests are safe at 34 (Tapoke Jahn is 34). The north coast and the Darkmist caves want 35+ (at 35 kill the Spiders and Recluses first), the road to the Shady Rest Inn 36+ (stay on the road), and Balos Jacken's camp 37, which is why it comes last. Under 35 at Theramore: do the town quests, then the west murlocs and Stinky (35-36) and let their kill XP carry you; nothing has to be carried forward
[OC]|cffffffffDustwallow Marsh|r  -  you start in Ironforge where chapter 31 left you, hearth = Booty Bay; it moves to Theramore on arrival. About 35,650 quest XP in all, every quest plain, no grind steps; the only collections are 40 Darkmist Eyes (~83% drop) and the shaman's 5 Water totems
